Relax the CUDA-vs-CPU tolerance for affine transformations of bounding boxes.
Backport of upstream commit:
https://github.com/pytorch/vision/commit/ca2212438fdd8ce29b66999ed70ed54b0f9372d1
and
Relax tolerances for CUDA float32 XYWHR bounding-box transform tests.
With PyTorch 2.9.1 and CUDA 12.9.1, torchvision 0.24.1 shows small
CPU-vs-CUDA numerical differences for rotated float32 XYWHR bounding boxes.

Author: Pavel Tomanek (Inuits/UGent) with help from ChatGPT5.6
